<view class="screen has-bottom"><view wx:if="{{demo}}" class="mode-banner">演示设置仅影响当前设备。</view><view class="settings-intro"><view class="eyebrow">留给我们的小档案</view><view class="title editorial">关于你，关于我们。</view></view><view class="card profile-paper"><view class="form-block"><text class="input-label">我的昵称</text><input placeholder-style="color:#766962" class="field" value="{{nickname}}" data-field="nickname" bindinput="input" maxlength="20"/></view><view class="form-block"><text class="input-label">小宇宙的名字</text><input placeholder-style="color:#766962" class="field" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="input" maxlength="40"/></view><view><text class="input-label">相恋的第一天</text><picker mode="date" value="{{startDate}}" bindchange="date"><view class="field">{{startDate}}</view></picker></view></view><view class="section between"><view class="title editorial">把重要的日子放在心上</view><button class="link" bindtap="add">＋ 添加</button></view><view wx:if="{{!anniversaries.length}}" class="card empty section"><view class="empty-symbol"><image aria-hidden="true" src="/assets/icon-calendar.png"/></view><view class="subtle">生日、第一次见面，或下次一起出发的日子。</view></view><view wx:for="{{anniversaries}}" wx:key="id" class="card anniversary-form"><input placeholder-style="color:#766962" class="field" value="{{item.title}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="title" bindinput="anniversary" maxlength="30" placeholder="例如：小宇的生日"/><picker mode="date" value="{{item.date}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="date" bindchange="anniversary"><view class="field date-picker">{{item.date}} <text>›</text></view></picker><view class="between"><view class="row"><switch color="#8E5265" checked="{{item.recurring}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="recurring" bindchange="anniversary"/><text class="subtle">每年重复</text></view><button class="link danger" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="remove">移除</button></view></view><view class="notice">相恋纪念日自动保留。2 月 29 日在非闰年按 2 月 28 日计算；这是纪念日显示规则，可随时修改记录日期。</view><view class="fixed-bottom"><button class="primary" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !ready}}">保存我们的资料</button></view></view>
